    "text": "<p>Choose from the options labeled A to E, the most appropriate question to the given sentence containing an emphatic stress word. The emphatic stress word is written in CAPITAL letters.<br>\n<br>\n<br>\nFarmers PLANT crops during the rainy season.</p>",
