    "explanation": "Let the forces be F1, and F2.<br>\nF1 = m1 a1 = 3 x 2 = 6N<br>\n<br>\nF2 = m2 a2 = 1 x 9 = 9N<br>\n<br>\nF1 : F2 = 6:9 = 2:3<br>\n<br>\nThus ratio of forces is 2: 3",
