    "text": "<p>Calculate the mass of ice that would melt when 2kg of copper is quickly transferred from boiling water to a block of ice without heat loss.<br>\nSpecific heat capacity of copper = 400JKg-1K-1<br>\nLatent heat of fusion of ice = 3.3 x 10\\(^5\\)JKg-1</p>",
