    "explanation": "Heat given off by the copper = MCt<br>\n= 2 x 400 x (100 - 0)<br>\nHeat absorbed by the ice = ML<br>\n= M x 3.3 x 10\\(^5\\)<br>\nHeat lost = Heat gained<br>\n∴ M x 3.3 x 10\\(^5\\) = 2 x 400 x 100<br>\n∴ M =\\(\\frac{(2 \\times&nbsp;400 \\times&nbsp;100)}{3.3 \\times&nbsp;10^5}\\)<br>\n= \\(\\frac{8}{33}\\)Kg",
