    "explanation": "\\(\\int_0^1 4x - 6^3\\sqrt&nbsp;x^2\\) dx<br>\n=\\(\\int_0^1 4x - 6x^{2/3}\\) dx<br>\n=\\((2x^2 - \\frac{8x^{5/3}}{5})_0^1\\)<br>\n=\\((2(1)^2 - \\frac{18(1)^{5/3}}{5}) - (2(0)^2 - \\frac{18(0)^{5/3}}{5}\\)<br>\n= - \\(\\frac{8}{5}\\) - 0<br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; - \\(\\frac{8}{5}\\)",
