    "explanation": "16\\(x^4 - y^4\\)<br>\n<br>\n= 2\\(^4x^4 - y^4\\)<br>\n<br>\n= \\((2x)^4 - y^4\\)<br>\n<br>\n= \\(((2x)^2)^2 - (y^2)^2\\)<br>\n<br>\nUsing a\\(^2 - b^2\\) = (a - b)(a + b) identity<br>\n<br>\n= ((2x)\\(^2 - y^2)((2x)^2 + y^2)\\)<br>\n<br>\nUsing the identity one more time<br>\n<br>\n= \\((2x - y)(2x + y)((2x)^2 + y^2)\\)<br>\n<br>\n∴ \\((2x - y)(2x + y)(4x^2 + y^2)\\)",
