    "correctOptionIndex": 3,
    "explanation": "Length of Arc AB = \\(\\frac{\\theta}{360}\\) 2\\(\\pi\\)r<br>\n<br>\n= \\(\\frac{48}{360}\\) x 2\\(\\frac{22}{7}\\) x \\(\\frac{21}{2}\\)<br>\n<br>\n= \\(\\frac{4 \\times 22 \\times \\times 3}{30}\\) \\(\\frac{88}{10}\\) = 8.8cm<br>\n<br>\nPerimeter = 8.8 + 2r<br>\n<br>\n= 8.8 + 2(10.5)<br>\n<br>\n= 8.8 + 21<br>\n<br>\n= 29.8cm",
    "subject": "Mathematics",
