    "explanation": "W \\(\\alpha\\) \\(\\frac{\\frac{1}{uv}}{u + v}\\)<br>\n<br>\n∴ w = \\(\\frac{\\frac{k}{uv}}{u + v}\\)<br>\n<br>\n= \\(\\frac{k(u + v)}{uv}\\)<br>\n<br>\nw = \\(\\frac{k(u + v)}{uv}\\)<br>\n<br>\nw = 8, u = 2 and v = 6<br>\n<br>\n8 = \\(\\frac{k(2 + 6)}{2(6)}\\)<br>\n<br>\n= \\(\\frac{k(8)}{12}\\)<br>\n<br>\nk = 12",
