    "explanation": "\\(x^{2} + 2xy + y^{2} + 3x + 3y - 18\\)<br>\n<br>\n\\(x^{2} + 2xy + 3x + y^{2} + 3y -18\\)<br>\n<br>\n\\(x^{2} + 2xy - 3x + 6x + y^{2} -3y + 6y -18\\)<br>\n<br>\n\\(x^{2} + 2xy -3x + y^{2} -3y + 6x + 6y -18\\)<br>\n<br>\n\\(x^{2} + xy -3x + xy + y^{2} - 3y + 6x + 6y -18\\)<br>\n<br>\nx(x + y - 3) + y(x + y - 3) + 6(x + y - 3)<br>\n<br>\n= (x + y - 3)(x + y + 6)<br>\n<br>\n= (x + y + 6)(x + y -3)",
