    "id": 1771752323550,
    "text": "<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<strong>I</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>6 X&nbsp; +&nbsp; 6 H\\(_2\\)O&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; →&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;C\\(_6\\)H\\(_{12}\\)O\\(_6\\)&nbsp; &nbsp;+&nbsp; &nbsp;6O\\(_2\\)&nbsp;</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>&nbsp;III&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;chlorophyll&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; II&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;IV</strong></p>\n\n<p>Use the diagram above to answer question that follows</p>\n\n<p>The part labelled I is</p>",
