    "text": "<p>The following&nbsp;balances was exgtracted from the books of Oluwalambe Ltd, manufacturer, on 31st December 2007</p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>Stock of raw materials 1 - 1 - 2007&nbsp;</td>\n\t\t\t<td>8000</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>Purchase of raw materials</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>450000</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>Stock of raw materials 31 - 12 - 2007&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>95000</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>Direct wages</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>65000</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>Indirect wages</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>28000</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>Depreciation on plants</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>32000</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>Factory rent</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>3500</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>Work in progress 1- 1- 2007&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>32500</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;Work in progress 31 - 12- 2007</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>37500</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>The prime cost is</p>",
