    "text": "<p>The following balances were extracted from the books of Adama Ltd on 31st August 2007</p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width:500px\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\n\t\t\t<td>#</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>Sales&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>200000</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;Drawings</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>10000</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;Land and building</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>70000</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>Furniture</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>10000</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>Debtors&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>50000</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>Creditors</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>35000</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>Capital&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>85000</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>Bank</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>10000</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>General expenses</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>10000</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>Stock ( 31-08-2007)&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>10000</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>Purchases&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>140000</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>Stock (1-09- 2006)&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>20000</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>Percentage of net profit to sale is&nbsp;<br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
