    "text": "<p>Use the following information to answer the question</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width:300px\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\n\t\t\t<td>$&nbsp;</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;Trade creditors (31/12/2020)</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;4,000</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;Paid for purchases in 2021: Cheques</td>\n\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;110,000</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;Carriage inwards</td>\n\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;1,000</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;Trade creditors (31/12/2021)</td>\n\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;6,000</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p><br>\n<br>\nThe total purchase in 2021 is</p>",
