    "correctOptionIndex": 3,
    "explanation": "To determine the total purchase in 2021, we need to sum up the amounts paid for purchases in 2021 and the carriage inwards.<br>\n<br>\nThe amounts are as follows:<br>\n<br>\nPaid for purchases in 2021 (cheques): $110,000<br>\nCarriage inwards: $1,000<br>\n<br>\nAdding these two amounts together gives us:<br>\n<br>\n$110,000 + $1,000 = $111,000<br>\n<br>\nTherefore, the total purchase in 2021 is $111,000.",
